WEBVTT

00:00:12.460 --> 00:00:16.290
Verone Academy

00:00:16.290 --> 00:00:17.990
I'm late! I'm late!

00:00:18.320 --> 00:00:18.960
I'm late!

00:00:25.100 --> 00:00:26.800
I made it!

00:00:28.880 --> 00:00:32.470
I guess I'll let it go just for today.

00:00:32.470 --> 00:00:34.440
Thank you.

00:00:34.440 --> 00:00:35.860
Dear teacher...

00:00:35.860 --> 00:00:37.990
You did it! You made it.

00:00:39.590 --> 00:00:42.660
Don't you think Ms. Yoshimi is 
being extremely generous today?

00:00:42.660 --> 00:00:43.710
That's true.

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:45.110
Everyone!

00:00:45.670 --> 00:00:49.370
I have an important 
announcement to make today.

00:00:49.580 --> 00:00:53.920
I, Yoshimi Takenouchi, 
will be getting married.

00:01:01.410 --> 00:01:04.010
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:01:04.010 --> 00:01:06.810
<i>Pretty Cure Pretty Cure</i>

00:01:06.810 --> 00:01:09.650
<i>Pretty Cure Pretty Cure</i>

00:01:09.650 --> 00:01:13.920
<i>We're pretty and cure cure Together we are...</i>

00:01:13.920 --> 00:01:16.890
<i>PRETTY CURE...!</i>

00:01:16.890 --> 00:01:19.760
<i>Out of the frying pan, into the fire</i>

00:01:19.760 --> 00:01:21.660
<i>Frankly, it's totally unbelievable</i>

00:01:22.860 --> 00:01:25.560
<i>Even in our school in our 
school uniforms, we're both</i>

00:01:25.560 --> 00:01:27.170
<i>amazingly tough</i>

00:01:28.670 --> 00:01:32.970
<i>Each time we get out of a tight spot, we both</i>

00:01:33.600 --> 00:01:35.070
<i>become stronger</i>

00:01:35.070 --> 00:01:38.840
<i>and closer</i>

00:01:39.840 --> 00:01:42.850
<i>Yeah! Your best! My best! Because we're alive</i>

00:01:42.850 --> 00:01:45.420
<i>we never fail!</i>

00:01:45.680 --> 00:01:48.590
<i>Don't you know that good fortune 
comes to the gates of laughter?</i>

00:01:48.590 --> 00:01:51.460
<i>Out with the negative!</i>

00:01:51.460 --> 00:01:57.730
<i>Brighten up your life!
Try with all your might...</i>

00:01:57.730 --> 00:01:58.630
<i>Work like the devil!</i>

00:01:58.630 --> 00:02:01.330
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:02:01.330 --> 00:02:04.140
<i>Pretty Cure! Pretty Cure!</i>

00:02:04.140 --> 00:02:07.040
<i>We're pretty and cure cure</i>

00:02:07.040 --> 00:02:08.610
<i>Together we are</i>

00:02:08.610 --> 00:02:11.680
<i>Pretty Cure...!</i>

00:02:22.870 --> 00:02:26.760
Isn't this pleasant? Even a 
small little piece like this...

00:02:26.760 --> 00:02:29.120
If you make the wrong move...

00:02:29.120 --> 00:02:30.430
It can be life-threatening.

00:02:30.430 --> 00:02:33.260
But you have to get what you want...

00:02:33.570 --> 00:02:34.950
Checkmate.

00:02:36.950 --> 00:02:39.070
The little one is suspicious.

00:02:39.310 --> 00:02:40.160
Huh?

00:02:42.440 --> 00:02:47.290
There's a king and a queen, 
but no little prince...

00:02:47.290 --> 00:02:48.010
Why is that?

00:02:48.210 --> 00:02:49.820
Little prince...?

00:02:50.000 --> 00:02:52.280
Little... little prince!

00:02:53.230 --> 00:02:56.750
Little girls... please protect Pollun.

00:02:56.950 --> 00:03:01.270
Popo... popo... popo!

00:03:06.600 --> 00:03:11.170
"GLITTERING TEARS! 
POURING SWEAT! A CHAOTIC WEDDING!!"

00:03:24.760 --> 00:03:28.430
When we followed Ryota to my dad's office,

00:03:28.430 --> 00:03:30.760
a dark warrior from Dotsuku 
Zone turned up again.

00:03:35.240 --> 00:03:38.990
The power that the Field of Light has, 
and the power of the Prism Stones...

00:03:41.420 --> 00:03:45.070
It seems like those dark warriors are 
getting closer and closer to the truth.

00:03:51.240 --> 00:03:54.810
But... but... but... Next Saturday...

00:03:55.280 --> 00:03:58.540
Isn't Ms. Yoshimi's wedding really sudden...?

00:03:58.540 --> 00:03:59.780
That's true.

00:04:00.060 --> 00:04:01.610
It can't be helped.

00:04:01.610 --> 00:04:05.600
The man she's marrying is going 
to be transferred overseas.

00:04:05.600 --> 00:04:08.560
Does that mean that Ms. Yoshimi 
will be going overseas, too?

00:04:08.710 --> 00:04:10.320
That's what would normally happen.

00:04:10.320 --> 00:04:12.870
Don't tell me that Ms. Yoshimi 
is going to quit teaching?

00:04:13.350 --> 00:04:16.520
No! No! That can't be!

00:04:16.520 --> 00:04:18.040
But it might happen...

00:04:18.830 --> 00:04:22.830
I thought we'd be with 
her until we graduated.

00:04:22.830 --> 00:04:23.810
What a shock!

00:04:24.310 --> 00:04:25.680
Now! Now, everybody...

00:04:25.680 --> 00:04:29.490
There's no use imagining things, 
and making a big fuss over it.

00:04:29.490 --> 00:04:31.220
She's right. Calm down, everybody.

00:04:31.390 --> 00:04:34.630
If you're worried about it, 
I'll ask Ms. Yoshimi about it.

00:04:34.990 --> 00:04:36.380
Let's go, Honoka.

00:04:38.910 --> 00:04:42.060
Don't worry. I won't quit.

00:04:42.060 --> 00:04:43.310
I thought so!

00:04:43.310 --> 00:04:44.650
But, Ms. Yoshimi...

00:04:44.650 --> 00:04:47.860
Isn't the man you're marrying going overseas?

00:04:48.050 --> 00:04:50.840
Won't you be lonely living apart?

00:04:50.840 --> 00:04:54.570
I might be, but I love teaching,

00:04:54.570 --> 00:04:57.490
so even after I get married, 
I plan to continue teaching.

00:04:57.490 --> 00:04:59.780
He understands that, too.

00:04:59.930 --> 00:05:01.470
Is that right?

00:05:01.470 --> 00:05:03.740
And besides, if he's not home,

00:05:03.960 --> 00:05:08.220
there won't be anyone to complain 
if I don't cook or clean the house.

00:05:08.220 --> 00:05:09.820
Ms. Yoshimi!

00:05:12.700 --> 00:05:14.370
Ms. Takenouchi....

00:05:14.760 --> 00:05:16.620
Congratulations!

00:05:16.620 --> 00:05:18.590
Thank you.

00:05:18.590 --> 00:05:25.560
Up until the day of my wedding was the 
best time of my life, but after that...

00:05:27.140 --> 00:05:29.050
Vice Principal!

00:05:29.750 --> 00:05:32.470
We're looking forward to the wedding.

00:05:33.690 --> 00:05:36.270
We'll have to think of a gift, won't we?

00:05:46.260 --> 00:05:47.480
Therefore...

00:05:47.480 --> 00:05:50.060
Ms. Yoshimi won't be quitting.

00:05:51.810 --> 00:05:53.670
Yeah! That's great! That's great!

00:05:53.670 --> 00:05:59.630
I was thinking that the whole class 
could give Ms. Yoshimi a gift.

00:05:59.840 --> 00:06:01.300
That's a good idea.

00:06:01.300 --> 00:06:02.830
What do you all think?

00:06:03.140 --> 00:06:05.240
I'm all for it. All for it.

00:06:05.780 --> 00:06:06.810
What shall we get her?

00:06:07.210 --> 00:06:10.280
Something she uses everyday 
would be good, wouldn't it?

00:06:10.530 --> 00:06:12.120
Like matching cups?

00:06:12.400 --> 00:06:13.600
If we're going to get her something,

00:06:13.600 --> 00:06:16.360
wouldn't it be nice to have 
something that's handmade?

00:06:16.360 --> 00:06:17.090
That's true.

00:06:17.090 --> 00:06:19.050
But if it's handmade...

00:06:19.050 --> 00:06:22.210
Is there something that 
the whole class can make?

00:06:27.130 --> 00:06:30.430
So this wedding...

00:06:30.670 --> 00:06:32.320
What is it like?

00:06:32.320 --> 00:06:34.780
There's going to be a cake as big as this...

00:06:34.780 --> 00:06:36.410
And lots of good food to eat.

00:06:36.580 --> 00:06:39.300
All you think of is food, Nagisa.

00:06:39.630 --> 00:06:44.420
A wedding is a ceremony where a man 
and a woman who love each other

00:06:44.420 --> 00:06:50.240
promise that they will be together 
for the rest of their lives.

00:06:50.640 --> 00:06:51.860
Love forever?

00:06:51.860 --> 00:06:54.560
That's just like us mepo.

00:06:54.740 --> 00:06:55.720
Mepple!

00:06:55.720 --> 00:06:56.390
Mipple!

00:06:58.730 --> 00:06:59.960
I wonder if it's going to be okay.

00:06:59.960 --> 00:07:00.490
What?

00:07:00.750 --> 00:07:02.020
Even after they're married,

00:07:02.020 --> 00:07:04.850
Ms. Yoshimi and her husband will 
be living apart, won't they?

00:07:06.860 --> 00:07:10.150
Even though Ms. Yoshimi was smiling 
when she said those things,

00:07:10.150 --> 00:07:12.640
I think she's really worried.

00:07:12.850 --> 00:07:16.940
Your father and mother are 
always overseas, aren't they?

00:07:22.830 --> 00:07:26.450
I have my grandmother and 
Chutaro, but even then,

00:07:26.450 --> 00:07:31.590
I sometimes wish my father 
and mother were here.

00:07:32.080 --> 00:07:33.340
I see...

00:07:33.560 --> 00:07:35.770
Ms. Yoshimi must be feeling lonely.

00:07:35.770 --> 00:07:38.280
We'll have to give her our support, won't we?

00:07:38.990 --> 00:07:41.300
Marriage... Marriage...

00:07:42.930 --> 00:07:45.920
This cushion is new, isn't it?

00:07:45.920 --> 00:07:47.660
It's an American quilt.

00:07:47.660 --> 00:07:50.580
My mother found it, and sent it to me.

00:07:52.050 --> 00:07:54.030
I thought it was just an ordinary pattern,

00:07:54.030 --> 00:07:57.050
but it's all different pieces of 
cloth sewn together, isn't it?

00:07:57.260 --> 00:08:02.020
In the days of the pioneers in America, 
even a little piece of cloth was valuable.

00:08:02.270 --> 00:08:06.430
That's why they would sew 
little pieces together

00:08:06.430 --> 00:08:09.790
to make something big, like a bedspread.

00:08:10.510 --> 00:08:12.630
Ah, I see...

00:08:12.630 --> 00:08:15.480
Do you think we could 
make one of these quilts?

00:08:17.700 --> 00:08:19.460
I think we can.

00:08:26.970 --> 00:08:30.960
This is all I have... Is it okay?

00:08:31.200 --> 00:08:33.070
You brought a lot, didn't you?

00:08:33.520 --> 00:08:35.990
Did you come up with a nice design, Mayu?

00:08:35.990 --> 00:08:38.500
I came up with several...

00:08:38.990 --> 00:08:40.180
What do you think?

00:08:40.470 --> 00:08:42.260
Just what I'd expect from 
someone in the art club.

00:08:43.130 --> 00:08:46.760
Taniguchi-san and I went to the 
library, and did some research...

00:08:46.760 --> 00:08:49.110
it looks like we should 
be able to make something

00:08:49.110 --> 00:08:51.430
if we use the appliqué technique 
even if it's our first time.

00:08:51.610 --> 00:08:56.310
When it comes to sewing, we have 
experience in sewing costumes, so...

00:08:56.310 --> 00:09:00.400
If you have any questions, we'll 
resolve it for you in no time at all.

00:09:00.400 --> 00:09:01.390
Right?

00:09:01.390 --> 00:09:04.090
No way! She got it wrong again.

00:09:04.090 --> 00:09:05.080
We're counting on you.

00:09:09.170 --> 00:09:11.570
Are you all still here?

00:09:11.570 --> 00:09:12.890
We're...

00:09:12.890 --> 00:09:14.190
...having dance practice...

00:09:14.510 --> 00:09:16.700
The samba that's quite popular lately.

00:09:16.700 --> 00:09:18.460
Was it that popular?

00:09:29.410 --> 00:09:32.020
Be sure you leave before 
the school gate closes.

00:09:39.260 --> 00:09:40.650
They're acting strange.

00:09:41.780 --> 00:09:52.800
Chikkun... chikkun... chikkun... chikkun...

00:09:51.180 --> 00:09:51.980
Ouch!

00:09:53.300 --> 00:09:56.370
Nagisa... you seem to be 
sewing your fingers mepo.

00:09:56.370 --> 00:09:57.720
Chikkun popo.

00:09:57.720 --> 00:09:59.310
I want to sew, too popo.

00:09:59.310 --> 00:10:00.200
No!

00:10:00.200 --> 00:10:03.270
I want to sew popo!

00:10:03.270 --> 00:10:04.910
Chikkun! Chikkun popo!

00:10:04.910 --> 00:10:07.310
Be quiet before someone hears you.

00:10:07.870 --> 00:10:08.960
Popo...

00:10:09.960 --> 00:10:12.270
I'm just no good at things like this.

00:10:12.270 --> 00:10:13.260
Nagisa!

00:10:13.260 --> 00:10:17.230
I'm coming in... Here... 
I ironed your blouse.

00:10:17.230 --> 00:10:19.050
Thank you!

00:10:19.290 --> 00:10:21.190
What are you making?

00:10:21.390 --> 00:10:25.160
A quilt that we're making for 
Ms. Yoshimi's wedding present,

00:10:25.160 --> 00:10:27.010
but it's not turning out the way I want it.

00:10:27.010 --> 00:10:28.800
Let me see how you're doing it...

00:10:30.790 --> 00:10:33.430
You're holding the cloth and needle wrong.

00:10:33.430 --> 00:10:37.220
Hold the cloth tight, and pull it as you sew,

00:10:37.220 --> 00:10:40.250
and move the needle and 
the cloth in rhythm...

00:10:41.900 --> 00:10:45.150
Wow! It's so much nicer than it was before.

00:10:45.150 --> 00:10:46.500
You have a good teacher.

00:10:46.500 --> 00:10:47.660
I have to hand it to you, Mom.

00:10:47.840 --> 00:10:49.980
It's no wonder Dad fell in love with you.

00:10:49.980 --> 00:10:52.360
Which one of you proposed?

00:10:52.720 --> 00:10:55.370
What a silly question all of a sudden!

00:10:55.370 --> 00:10:56.540
Go to sleep.

00:10:59.100 --> 00:11:01.400
Mom was embarrassed. I think it's cute.

00:11:02.940 --> 00:11:04.780
Marriage...?

00:11:28.050 --> 00:11:29.590
It's scary mepo...

00:11:29.910 --> 00:11:33.800
Chikkun... chikkun... chikkun... chikkun...

00:11:50.520 --> 00:11:53.320
Hang in there. Just one more day!

00:11:55.340 --> 00:11:57.580
It's coming along really nicely, isn't it?

00:11:57.860 --> 00:12:00.770
You've gotten really good 
at sewing, haven't you?

00:12:00.770 --> 00:12:01.840
I suppose...

00:12:04.420 --> 00:12:05.960
You're kidding! I don't believe it!

00:12:06.260 --> 00:12:08.740
She sewed it together with her skirt.

00:12:13.220 --> 00:12:15.820
Everybody! We're almost finished with it.

00:12:15.820 --> 00:12:16.600
Let's do our best.

00:12:54.300 --> 00:12:57.870
There'll be a lot of people attending 
today, so let's put some spirit into it.

00:13:12.330 --> 00:13:13.710
What are you doing?

00:13:23.090 --> 00:13:26.250
Ms. Yoshimi doesn't know 
that we're coming, does she?

00:13:28.230 --> 00:13:30.180
I'm sure she'll be surprised.

00:13:30.180 --> 00:13:32.690
Will the others come on time?

00:13:32.690 --> 00:13:33.610
I'm sure they will...

00:13:33.610 --> 00:13:36.630
It's Ms. Yoshimi's wedding, 
and they all love her.

00:13:39.600 --> 00:13:40.530
Hello!

00:13:40.530 --> 00:13:41.570
We'll borrow this room.

00:13:52.750 --> 00:13:55.920
They use all this for weddings...?

00:13:55.920 --> 00:13:59.210
Nagisa... I have a bad feeling 
about this place mepo.

00:13:59.450 --> 00:14:02.420
Really? It has some interesting things.

00:14:02.420 --> 00:14:05.750
I feel the presence of evil here mipo.

00:14:08.640 --> 00:14:10.190
It's a cake!

00:14:13.010 --> 00:14:14.360
It's a fake!

00:14:14.690 --> 00:14:18.110
Something as big as this is 
probably just a decoration.

00:14:18.110 --> 00:14:21.520
Although there people who 
being homemade cakes.

00:14:21.520 --> 00:14:24.880
Then what about when they cut the cake?

00:14:25.690 --> 00:14:29.220
Isn't this where they use 
a real piece of cake?

00:14:29.220 --> 00:14:30.510
I...

00:14:35.050 --> 00:14:36.970
They're here mepo!

00:14:50.780 --> 00:14:52.730
How could you come here?

00:14:52.970 --> 00:14:55.540
Today is an important day for Ms. Yoshimi...

00:14:55.540 --> 00:14:57.950
We won't let you interfere!

00:15:01.940 --> 00:15:04.390
Dual Aurora Wave!

00:15:31.840 --> 00:15:34.140
Protector of the Light, Cure Black!

00:15:34.400 --> 00:15:36.740
Protector of the Light, Cure White!

00:15:38.830 --> 00:15:40.520
Together, we're Pretty Cure!

00:15:41.750 --> 00:15:43.880
Servants of the power of darkness...

00:15:44.800 --> 00:15:47.320
Go back to where you came from!

00:15:56.600 --> 00:15:58.330
Ms. Yoshimi's present!

00:16:00.760 --> 00:16:03.520
We all worked hard to make that...

00:16:03.520 --> 00:16:04.740
It's unforgivable!

00:16:20.920 --> 00:16:24.050
As this rate, Ms. Yoshimi's 
wedding will be...

00:16:24.050 --> 00:16:25.600
...ruined!

00:16:25.830 --> 00:16:27.580
We have to stop him!

00:16:28.460 --> 00:16:30.460
It has nothing to do with me.

00:16:30.470 --> 00:16:35.040
All I'm interested in is you two, and where 
the power of the Prism Stones is hidden.

00:16:35.380 --> 00:16:39.370
That's all the more reason why you have 
no right to interfere with the wedding.

00:16:39.610 --> 00:16:44.510
That's right... Just go back to 
Dotsuku Zone, and leave us alone!

00:16:44.510 --> 00:16:46.500
Stay out of everybody's way!

00:16:46.500 --> 00:16:48.480
Is that all you have to say?

00:17:06.970 --> 00:17:09.140
You don't seem to understand...

00:17:10.200 --> 00:17:12.270
The two of you are just the key...

00:17:12.640 --> 00:17:18.080
The key to unlock the puzzles of how 
Jyaku-King can possess the different worlds.

00:17:18.790 --> 00:17:21.030
You don't have the time 
to be getting involved

00:17:21.030 --> 00:17:26.520
in little things like this in 
the far corners of this world!

00:17:26.520 --> 00:17:29.220
Little...? Did you say "little"?

00:17:29.770 --> 00:17:34.190
Everyone is here to bless 
these two people in love

00:17:34.190 --> 00:17:37.570
who are about to start 
their new lives together...

00:17:38.160 --> 00:17:39.960
They say these vows...

00:17:39.960 --> 00:17:42.030
...because everyone wants happiness and 
hopes for their happiness together.

00:17:42.220 --> 00:17:45.000
It's not a little thing!

00:17:45.000 --> 00:17:49.410
Happiness? Do you know 
the meaning of happiness?

00:17:49.670 --> 00:17:55.830
Everything in all the world is destined to 
be annihilated and swallowed up by Dotsuku Zone.

00:17:56.090 --> 00:17:59.390
There's no way someone 
like you would understand.

00:17:59.390 --> 00:18:03.840
Isn't happiness what we build right 
here where we stand right now?

00:18:04.160 --> 00:18:07.080
That's right... We'll overcome that destiny,

00:18:07.080 --> 00:18:09.330
and show you that we'll all find happiness.

00:18:47.580 --> 00:18:49.280
There's no future for you...

00:18:49.610 --> 00:18:52.920
Can't you do anything without 
that little creature?

00:18:53.530 --> 00:18:56.760
Someone like you who doesn't 
know what happiness is...

00:18:56.960 --> 00:18:58.810
Even without Pollun's help...

00:18:58.810 --> 00:19:00.350
We'll get rid of the likes of you!

00:19:00.350 --> 00:19:01.240
White...

00:19:02.990 --> 00:19:04.820
Black Thunder!

00:19:05.250 --> 00:19:07.290
White Thunder!

00:19:15.400 --> 00:19:18.310
The beautiful souls of Pretty Cure...!

00:19:18.520 --> 00:19:21.140
...will crush the sinister hearts!

00:19:22.190 --> 00:19:25.650
Pretty Cure Marble Screw!

00:19:41.790 --> 00:19:46.140
Today is an important day for 
Ms. Yoshimi and for us, too.

00:19:49.110 --> 00:19:51.570
We won't let the likes of you get in our way!

00:19:58.740 --> 00:20:00.180
This power...

00:20:00.180 --> 00:20:02.170
It's nothing like the power from before...

00:20:02.760 --> 00:20:07.140
In order to make this a day that Ms. Yoshimi

00:20:07.140 --> 00:20:09.220
will remember for the rest of her life...

00:20:30.070 --> 00:20:31.820
Ms. Yoshimi's present!

00:20:44.100 --> 00:20:45.280
Thank goodness!

00:20:57.750 --> 00:20:59.120
Congratulations!

00:21:08.360 --> 00:21:09.670
Congratulations!

00:21:15.950 --> 00:21:17.400
Ms. Yoshimi's beautiful.

00:21:17.400 --> 00:21:18.920
You're right... She's positively glowing.

00:21:19.120 --> 00:21:22.080
Congratulations, Ms. Yoshimi!

00:21:22.080 --> 00:21:24.150
